---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@200..1000&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>About | SGA Nexus Intelligence</title>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 font-sans min-h-screen p-4 md:p-12 overflow-x-hidden bg-[#020617]">

<div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-[20%] -left-[20%] w-[120%] h-[120%] bg-orange-500/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full animate-mesh-fast"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
</div>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <header class="mb-16 border-b border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <a href="/" class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] hover:text-white transition-colors">← Return to Dashboard</a>
        <h1 style="font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;" class="text-5xl tracking-tighter text-white font-black uppercase mt-4">
            THE <span class="text-orange-500">SGA</span> DOSSIER
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-widest mt-2">Bilateral Tech-Consultancy & Digital Ecosystem</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-16">

        <section>
            <span class="text-orange-500 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">01. Organization</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">Superior Gaming Agency</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
                <p>
                    <b class="text-white">SGA</b> is an international technology-concierge organization dedicated to high-end digital solutions. We operate as a bridge between specialized hardware needs and advanced software management, ensuring that users maintain peak operational efficiency through tactical precision.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Beyond pure tech, SGA acts as a strategic hub for bilateral innovation, leveraging international partnerships to redefine how users interact with their hardware and their own creative output.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <span class="text-indigo-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">02. Collective Intelligence</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">The Nexus Protocol</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    <b class="text-white">Nexus</b> is our advanced communication and brainstorming environment. It replaces unstructured group discussion with a high-throughput **Brainwriting (6-3-5)** methodology. By enforcing synchronized ideation, Nexus eliminates "Process Loss" and production blocking, ensuring that the team’s collective output is exponentially greater than the sum of individual ideas.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-24 h-24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">03. The Consulting Phase</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">Next-Gen Advisory</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                <p>
                    Our consulting wing is anchored by the <b class="text-white">SGA Agent</b>. While serving as a telemetry bridge, the next evolution of the Agent incorporates <b class="text-orange-500">Autonomous Technical Consulting</b>.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-2 text-justify">
                    The Agent analyzes your system’s unique hardware signature to provide bespoke advice—recommending optimizations and detecting bottlenecks before they occur.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-12 mb-24">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-slate-500 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase italic">The Innovation Corridor</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase italic mt-1">Bilateral Foundations</h2>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        SGA is a testament to international cooperation. Driven by <b class="text-white">two prominent Iranian investors</b> and guided by my own <b class="text-orange-500">Persian roots</b>, the project is built on a foundation of cross-border capital and cultural vision.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        Operating from Hungary, I act as the technical and cultural conduit between Tehran's strategic core and our European operations. By establishing this bridge, we leverage a massive, untapped reservoir of Persian engineering ingenuity.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm italic border-l-2 border-orange-500 pl-4">
                        This corridor allows for the seamless exchange of ideas, where Hungarian engineering traditions meet the rapid, adaptive problem-solving inherent in my heritage. SGA doesn't just hire talent; we unify two distinct worlds of innovation to create the Nexus ecosystem.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-2xl flex justify-around items-center h-40 shadow-2xl">
                        <div class="text-center group">
                            <div class="text-3xl font-bold transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">🇮🇷</div>
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-white font-black mt-2 uppercase tracking-tighter">Heritage</div>
                            <div class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-1 uppercase">Strategic Source</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="relative h-16 w-16 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-orange-500/20 blur-xl rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8 text-slate-700" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7h12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4m0 6H4m0 0l4 4m-4-4l4-4" /></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-center group">
                            <div class="text-3xl font-bold transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">🇭🇺</div>
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-white font-black mt-2 uppercase tracking-tighter">Implementation</div>
                            <div class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-mono mt-1 uppercase">Operations Hub</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-orange-500/5 border border-orange-500/10 p-4 rounded-xl text-center">
                        <p class="text-[9px] font-mono text-orange-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] leading-relaxed">
                            Lineage Authentication: Active // Bilateral Sync: Stable // Nexus Node: Online
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
</div>

<style is:global>
    @keyframes move-mesh {
        0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
        50% { transform: translate(10%, 5%) scale(1.05); }
        100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
    }
    .animate-mesh-fast { animation: move-mesh 15s infinite alternate ease-in-out; }
    .text-justify { text-justify: inter-word; hyphens: auto; }
</style>
</body>
</html>